This project is built on, and its installer bundles the source code of, nfshp2-port-win by ZloiKILLER
(https://github.com/ZloiKILLER/nfshp2-port-win): the static recompiler of the game and the PS2 runtime. Its files keep their
authorship; this project's changes to them are in patches/. Anyone reusing this project's code: keep this credit, and the link to
ZloiKILLER's project, with it.

Files from nfshp2-web by Vitorini (mac/web/) are under the MIT License (LICENSES/MIT-nfshp2-web.txt). The installer's scripts adapt
NFSU2Deadware's by LeoDeadware (MIT, LICENSES/MIT-NFSU2Deadware.txt). Third-party libraries: THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

No game code or data is part of this project or its releases: the game is built on the player's Mac from their own disc.
